WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.612
Welcome to The Signal, the free first gate to Numinous.

00:00:08.612 --> 00:00:14.391
This room gives you the First Vision, Dispatches, the calendar of upcoming realms, and the Sanctuary.

00:00:14.391 --> 00:00:18.003
Every new realm reaches The Signal before the wider feed.

00:00:18.003 --> 00:00:20.171
You can join without a card.

00:00:20.171 --> 00:00:24.144
There is no renewal, and no requirement to buy another work.

00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:29.201
If you want a more paced practice, The Watcher is a separate, optional membership.

00:00:29.201 --> 00:00:34.980
For now, open the free gate on Whop and take your time with the first vision.
